{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/text/yehi_ratzon_temple","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n32.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"text":"May it find favour before Thee, O Lord our God and God of our fathers, that the sanctuary be rebuilt speedily in our days, and grant our portion in Thy Torah. There we will serve Thee in awe as in the days of old and former years. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"4","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:malachi/3/4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:malachi/3/4"}}
{"text":"And pleasant unto the Lord shall be the offering of Judah and Jerusalem as in the days of old and former years."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
